  "text": "<|open|>message role=\"system\" type=\"tool-declare\"<|sep|># Tools\nHere are the available tools, described in JSONSchema.\n\n```json\n[{\"function\":{\"description\":\"날씨를 조회한다 / 查询天气 / get the weather\",\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"location\":{\"description\":\"City name\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"unit\":{\"enum\":[\"c\",\"f\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"location\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"},{\"function\":{\"name\":\"search\",\"parameters\":{\"properties\":{\"q\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}},\"type\":\"function\"}]\n```<|close|>message<|sep|><|end_of_msg|><|open|>message role=\"system\" type=\"thinking-effort\"<|sep|>`thinking_effort` guides on how much to think in your thinking channel (not including the response channel), supported values include `low`, `medium`, `high`, and `max`.\nNow the system is invoked with `thinking_effort=max`.<|close|>message<|sep|><|end_of_msg|><|open|>message role=\"user\"<|sep|>Do not use a tool.<|close|>message<|sep|><|end_of_msg|><|open|>message role=\"system\" type=\"tool-choice\"<|sep|>The system is invoked with `tool_choice=none`.\nYou MUST NOT call any tools in the next message.<|close|>message<|sep|><|end_of_msg|><|open|>message role=\"assistant\"<|sep|><|open|>think<|sep|>",
